-4bf7-8c06-829623301826\" />\n\nEvery subsequent run\n\nUpdate: The viewport size is always fine after the the first attempt but the shown resolution is not updated sometimes (until you interact with the window or re-run).\n\n<img width=\"1356\" height=\"1010\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8d16e3c-dd79-494e-bcf0-6cdc537e43e9\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Change viewport size e.g. to 1280x720\n- Run project or current scene\n- The first time the shown embedded resolution is lower, e.g. 1063x598\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115559/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}